  "en": "And the crucifix?",
  "start": 816.51,
  "end": 817.97
 },
 {
  "en": "I ripped it off",
  "start": 818.01,
  "end": 819.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Maricruz before she ran.",
  "start": 819.24,
  "end": 820.61
 },
 {
  "en": "There was no phone in that dump, so I knew you wouldn't be able to call from the road to...",
  "start": 820.64,
  "end": 824.71
 },
 {
  "en": "To make sure I wasn't lying.",
  "start": 824.74,
  "end": 828.04
 },
 {
  "en": "I-I conned you.",
  "start": 828.07,
  "end": 830.01
 },
 {
  "en": "So...",
  "start": 830.04,
  "end": 831.27
 },
 {
  "en": "So Maricruz is...",
  "start": 831.31,
  "end": 834.47
 },
 {
  "en": "She's picking grapes.",
  "start": 834.51,
  "end": 835.91
 },
 {
  "en": "I have no idea.",
  "start": 835.94,
  "end": 837.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, just lower the barrel.",
  "start": 837.84,
  "end": 839.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Put the gun down.",
  "start": 839.54,
  "end": 841.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, I came clean with you and helped you out, right, buddy?",
  "start": 846.74,
  "end": 850.97
 },
 {
  "en": "So you got to return the favor.",
  "start": 851.01,
  "end": 853.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Call my mom in Joliet-- Edna Bellick.",
  "start": 853.24,
  "end": 857.41
 },
 {
  "en": "She's listed. Sucre?",
  "start": 857.44,
  "end": 859.07
 },
 {
  "en": "I never laid a hand on Maricruz.",
  "start": 859.11,
  "end": 861.01
 },
 {
  "en": "I would never do that!",
  "start": 861.04,
  "end": 862.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre, help me, please!",
  "start": 862.81,
  "end": 865.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre, help me!",
  "start": 865.64,
  "end": 868.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Help me!",
  "start": 868.54,
  "end": 870.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, man.",
  "start": 880.84,
  "end": 882.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh.",
  "start": 907.97,
  "end": 910.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey.",
  "start": 935.91,
  "end": 938.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey.",
  "start": 938.04,
  "end": 939.61
 },
 {
  "en": "You find Whistler?",
  "start": 939.64,
  "end": 941.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 941.47,
  "end": 942.97
 },
 {
  "en": "What's his story?",
  "start": 943.01,
  "end": 945.11
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know, and maybe it's better that way, huh?",
  "start": 945.14,
  "end": 948.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I just got to get him out of here, right?",
  "start": 948.84,
  "end": 952.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, man, come on.",
  "start": 952.07,
  "end": 953.24
 },
 {
  "en": "We got to keep moving, we got to keep moving.",
  "start": 953.27,
  "end": 955.41
 },
 {
  "en": "What's the next play?",
  "start": 955.44,
  "end": 956.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Whistler got a note out on a dead body yesterday.",
  "start": 956.61,
  "end": 960.37
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know what it means or who it's for.",
  "start": 960.41,
  "end": 963.97
 },
 {
  "en": "But we need all the leverage we can get, and, uh...",
  "start": 965.34,
  "end": 969.11
 },
 {
  "en": "I need some money.",
  "start": 969.14,
  "end": 970.87
 },
 {
  "en": "No one's ever broken out of this place before, let alone with a week to plan it, so...",
  "start": 980.47,
  "end": 987.84
 },
 {
  "en": "You tell these people, whoever it is that took Sara and my nephew...",
  "start": 987.87,
  "end": 995.04
 },
 {
  "en": "You tell them I get it, and I'm going to do everything I can.",
  "start": 995.07,
  "end": 1000.57
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm going to break this guy out of here, or I'm going to die trying.",
  "start": 1000.64,
  "end": 1005.91
 },
 {
  "en": "And if it's the latter, then that should count for something, right?",
  "start": 1005.94,
  "end": 1010.61
 },
 {
  "en": "That's got to count for something.",
  "start": 1010.64,
  "end": 1012.71
 },
 {
  "en": "You tell them that.",
  "start": 1012.74,
  "end": 1014.34
 },
 {
  "en": "I will.",
  "start": 1014.37,
  "end": 1015.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell them.",
  "start": 1015.81,
  "end": 1017.34
 },
 {
  "en": "I'd trade places with you in a second.",
  "start": 1017.37,
  "end": 1019.61
 },
 {
  "en": "I know.",
  "start": 1022.54,
  "end": 1025.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Whistler?",
  "start": 1028.24,
  "end": 1031.27
 },
 {
  "en": "You're not safe here.",
  "start": 1051.91,
  "end": 1053.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I can take you someplace that is.",
  "start": 1056.44,
  "end": 1059.24
 },
 {
  "en": "If you're here to help me, then just leave me alone.",
  "start": 1064.07,
  "end": 1070.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Please.",
  "start": 1074.17,
  "end": 1075.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre?",
  "start": 1092.15,
  "end": 1094.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc!",
  "start": 1094.98,
  "end": 1096.38
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you doing here?",
  "start": 1096.42,
  "end": 1097.75
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you doing here?",
  "start": 1097.78,
  "end": 1099.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael's locked up.",
  "start": 1099.42,
  "end": 1100.45
 },
 {
  "en": "For what?",
  "start": 1100.48,
  "end": 1101.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know. I'm sorting it through.",
  "start": 1101.98,
  "end": 1103.78
 },
 {
  "en": "I could use your help.",
  "start": 1103.82,
  "end": 1105.12
 },
 {
  "en": "We're in a... we're in a bad spot.",
  "start": 1105.15,
  "end": 1107.62
 },
 {
  "en": "Uh, I feel for you, man, but I'm done with bad spots, Linc.",
  "start": 1107.65,
  "end": 1110.55
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm going to go see Maricruz.",
  "start": 1110.58,
  "end": 1112.05
 },
 {
  "en": "I just talked to my cousin Petey, and he told me she's back over in Chicago.",
  "start": 1112.08,
  "end": 1115.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, you're still wanted in Chicago, remember?",
  "start": 1115.08,
  "end": 1117.08
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll figure something out.",
  "start": 1117.12,
  "end": 1119.02
 },
 {
  "en": "All right.",
  "start": 1121.62,
  "end": 1123.65
 },
 {
  "en": "If you change your mind, I'm staying at the Plaza del Sol.",
  "start": 1123.68,
  "end": 1125.82
 },
 {
  "en": "I won't. I'm-I'm out of here, bro.",
  "start": 1125.85,
  "end": 1127.85
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm going to go see my girl.",
  "start": 1127.88,
  "end": 1129.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen to me. The innocent people in your life you got to keep them innocent-- if that means walking away from them, that's what you got to do.",
  "start": 1129.22,
  "end": 1136.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Good luck, Linc.",
  "start": 1138.32,
  "end": 1139.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Banco de Versailles, por favor.",
  "start": 1159.48,
  "end": 1162.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Have we had our laughs with him yet?",
  "start": 1164.31,
  "end": 1166.44
 },
 {
  "en": "He's useless, man.",
  "start": 1166.48,
  "end": 1168.58
 },
 {
  "en": "You want to get rid of him?",
  "start": 1168.61,
  "end": 1169.88
 },
 {
  "en": "Huh? Then you cut the mango. Huh?",
  "start": 1169.91,
  "end": 1172.28
 },
 {
  "en": "You caused me a big, big problem out there today!",
  "start": 1172.31,
  "end": 1175.11
 },
 {
  "en": "You understand that?",
  "start": 1175.14,
  "end": 1176.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Now there's no more water.",
  "start": 1176.48,
  "end": 1177.98
 },
 {
  "en": "They'll live.",
  "start": 1178.01,
  "end": 1179.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, yeah?",
  "start": 1179.21,
  "end": 1180.54
 },
 {
  "en": "They'll live?",
  "start": 1180.58,
  "end": 1181.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah? Well, you tell them that, then.",
  "start": 1181.78,
  "end": 1184.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, come out, Your Majesty.",
  "start": 1185.31,
  "end": 1189.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Teodoro!",
  "start": 1189.24,
  "end": 1189.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you scared of...",
  "start": 1190.01,
  "end": 1192.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Little people like us?",
  "start": 1192.21,
  "end": 1195.44
 },
 {
  "en": "There's water here.",
  "start": 1195.48,
  "end": 1198.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Give each man a little, hey?",
  "start": 1198.18,
  "end": 1199.71
 },
 {
  "en": "At once.",
  "start": 1199.74,
  "end": 1201.54
 },
 {
  "en": "The kings have their heads chopped off.",
  "start": 1203.91,
  "end": 1206.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, Lechero!",
  "start": 1206.64,
  "end": 1208.64
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry about us!",
  "start": 1208.68,
  "end": 1211.64
 },
 {
  "en": "We're fine!",
  "start": 1211.68,
  "end": 1213.61
 },
 {
  "en": "He may have ruled the streets out there, but in here, he's just like us.",
  "start": 1213.64,
  "end": 1219.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Just like us!",
  "start": 1220.01,
  "end": 1221.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Come out!",
  "start": 1221.44,
  "end": 1222.44
 },
 {
  "en": "What, are you afraid?",
  "start": 1222.48,
  "end": 1223.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Come and look at me!",
  "start": 1223.84,
  "end": 1226.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on!",
  "start": 1226.14,
  "end": 1227.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Lechero, come out.",
  "start": 1227.48,
  "end": 1229.41
 },
 {
  "en": "The American in his underwear-- you seen him?",
  "start": 1229.44,
  "end": 1231.38
 },
 {
  "en": "T-Bag.",
  "start": 1241.88,
  "end": 1244.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Boy, you're going to be drinking your own urine before you get any of this.",
  "start": 1244.04,
  "end": 1248.31
 },
 {
  "en": "I just need to speak to Señor Lechero, please?",
  "start": 1248.34,
  "end": 1251.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Why don't you do yourself a favor-- scamper.",
  "start": 1251.14,
  "end": 1253.38
 },
 {
  "en": "But I got something. Oh, yeah.",
  "start": 1253.41,
  "end": 1255.14
 },
 {
  "en": "You got yourself the untouchable status.",
  "start": 1255.18,
  "end": 1258.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Get myself killed just talking to your mangy ass.",
  "start": 1258.21,
  "end": 1261.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Andale.",
  "start": 1262.94,
  "end": 1265.24
 },
 {
  "en": "But I got information.",
  "start": 1265.28,
  "end": 1266.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Good information.",
  "start": 1266.71,
  "end": 1271.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you out of your mind, huh?",
  "start": 1282.78,
  "end": 1285.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey! Hey! Hey! He's got info.",
  "start": 1285.41,
  "end": 1287.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Pick a... pick a kneecap, huh?",
  "start": 1287.04,
  "end": 1288.44
 },
 {
  "en": "I got information! I just want food and clothing.",
  "start": 1288.48,
  "end": 1290.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Patron, please.",
  "start": 1290.64,
  "end": 1291.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Hold on. Hold on!",
  "start": 1291.41,
  "end": 1293.54
 },
 {
  "en": "This better be informative.",
  "start": 1295.88,
  "end": 1297.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Or it's your kneecap next.",
  "start": 1297.78,
  "end": 1300.08
 },
 {
  "en": "This morning, before that whole, uh, water thing, I, I heard you and the lads talking about that Whistler character, how he's found him.",
  "start": 1301.94,
  "end": 1310.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Well...",
  "start": 1310.11,
  "end": 1311.74
 },
 {
  "en": "I just want food and clothing...",
  "start": 1311.78,
  "end": 1313.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Just tell him, idiot!",
  "start": 1313.64,
  "end": 1314.51
 },
 {
  "en": "There's a guy hiding down in the sewers.",
  "start": 1314.54,
  "end": 1317.01
 },
 {
  "en": "I-I figure he's hiding from you, right, because you run this place, right?",
  "start": 1317.04,
  "end": 1320.34
 },
 {
  "en": "And so I figured you'd want to know everything goes on here, so...",
  "start": 1320.38,
  "end": 1322.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Fine, shut up.",
  "start": 1323.01,
  "end": 1324.04
 },
 {
  "en": "It just might be Whistler, si, patron?",
  "start": 1324.08,
  "end": 1326.21
 },
 {
  "en": "¿Sí?",
  "start": 1326.24,
  "end": 1328.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Is he Australian?",
  "start": 1334.14,
  "end": 1336.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 1336.61,
  "end": 1338.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah!",
  "start": 1338.48,
  "end": 1341.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Courtesy of the Lechero's munificence.",
  "start": 1351.61,
  "end": 1354.81
 },
 {
  "en": "All right, now, y'all need to back up a tad now.",
  "start": 1356.91,
  "end": 1360.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey.",
  "start": 1360.74,
  "end": 1362.44
 },
 {
  "en": "How long you been in Sona?",
  "start": 1362.48,
  "end": 1364.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Three years.",
  "start": 1364.08,
  "end": 1366.58
 },
 {
  "en": "How old are you?",
  "start": 1366.61,
  "end": 1368.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Seventeen.",
  "start": 1368.14,
  "end": 1369.48
 },
 {
  "en": "And as far as you know, no one's ever broken out of this place except, uh... except maybe this Whistler guy?",
  "start": 1369.51,
  "end": 1376.81
 },
 {
  "en": "You Americans ask a lot of questions.",
  "start": 1377.94,
  "end": 1380.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, no.",
  "start": 1394.18,
  "end": 1396.14
 },
 {
  "en": "What's wrong?",
  "start": 1396.18,
  "end": 1397.64
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on. Please.",
  "start": 1397.68,
  "end": 1399.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on! I have a family.",
  "start": 1399.28,
  "end": 1400.71
 },
 {
  "en": "S-So do I.",
  "start": 1400.74,
  "end": 1402.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on.",
  "start": 1402.58,
  "end": 1404.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Stop!",
  "start": 1405.81,
  "end": 1406.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Stop, okay?",
  "start": 1406.88,
  "end": 1409.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Just...",
  "start": 1409.21,
  "end": 1411.44
 },
 {
  "en": "He's coming with me.",
  "start": 1422.38,
  "end": 1425.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Just back up, Michael. Just...",
  "start": 1441.38,
  "end": 1444.15
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't actually think that killing somebody is going to help you get out of here, do you?",
  "start": 1447.22,
  "end": 1450.88
 },
 {
  "en": "That does seem pretty strange, doesn't it?",
  "start": 1450.92,
  "end": 1453.28
 },
 {
  "en": "But this is a really strange place, one I want to get out of.",
  "start": 1453.32,
  "end": 1456.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Then I'll help you.",
  "start": 1456.85,
  "end": 1458.32
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll testify for you, whatever it takes. Wow.",
  "start": 1458.35,
  "end": 1461.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Wow, look at that halo that just appeared above your head.",
  "start": 1461.25,
  "end": 1464.62
 },
 {
  "en": "It's amazing.",
  "start": 1464.65,
  "end": 1465.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't have a choice, Alex... What'd you tell me yesterday?",
  "start": 1465.98,
  "end": 1468.42
 },
 {
  "en": "What did you tell me yesterday?",
  "start": 1468.45,
  "end": 1469.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Huh? \"You're on your own, Alex.\"",
  "start": 1469.48,
  "end": 1471.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Back up. Back up!",
  "start": 1471.28,
  "end": 1473.88
 },
 {
  "en": "You...",
  "start": 1475.45,
  "end": 1477.42
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't want this.",
  "start": 1477.45,
  "end": 1479.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Let me help you, Alex.",
  "start": 1479.58,
  "end": 1482.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, your majesty!",
  "start": 1497.02,
  "end": 1499.08
 },
 {
  "en": "You got to shut him up.",
  "start": 1500.42,
  "end": 1502.65
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on!",
  "start": 1502.68,
  "end": 1504.62
 },
 {
  "en": "I need this bolson to call me back.",
  "start": 1504.65,
  "end": 1506.78
 },
 {
  "en": "I need to talk to you.",
  "start": 1506.82,
  "end": 1508.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't ever walk in here without being called! I'm sorry.",
  "start": 1508.25,
  "end": 1510.95
 },
 {
  "en": "But it's worth the breach in etiquette.",
  "start": 1510.98,
  "end": 1512.28
 },
 {
  "en": "Is it now?",
  "start": 1512.32,
  "end": 1513.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I thought you could use my help.",
  "start": 1513.22,
  "end": 1514.78
 },
 {
  "en": "There are ways I can be of assistance.",
  "start": 1514.82,
  "end": 1517.08
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 1520.22,
  "end": 1522.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Whistler don't mean nothing to me, man.",
  "start": 1522.28,
  "end": 1525.52
 },
 {
  "en": "I have five consecutive life sentences-- I ain't coming out of Sona no time soon.",
  "start": 1525.55,
  "end": 1528.95
 },
 {
  "en": "And why should I deprive other men of chance at freedom?",
  "start": 1528.98,
  "end": 1530.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Huh? I need you to trust me.",
  "start": 1530.72,
  "end": 1532.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh.",
  "start": 1532.08,
  "end": 1533.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Trust you?",
  "start": 1534.02,
  "end": 1535.68
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know you good enough, brother.",
  "start": 1537.88,
  "end": 1540.28
 },
 {
  "en": "Teodoro.",
  "start": 1542.05,
  "end": 1543.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Si, patron?",
  "start": 1544.68,
  "end": 1546.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Can I trust this bobo?",
  "start": 1553.58,
  "end": 1555.72
 },
 {
  "en": "He's a snake.",
  "start": 1558.05,
  "end": 1560.32
 },
 {
  "en": "He stabbed me in the back every chance he got.",
  "start": 1560.35,
  "end": 1565.78
 },
 {
  "en": "A snake who stab a man in the back.",
  "start": 1565.82,
  "end": 1569.98
